"""
EditTab — 视频工作台
视频播放 + 时间裁剪 + 特效管理 + 拼接，一个界面完成
【开发状态：已完成】
"""

import os
from PyQt6.QtWidgets import (
    QWidget, QVBoxLayout, QHBoxLayout, QLabel, QPushButton,
    QGroupBox, QFileDialog, QDoubleSpinBox, QListWidget, QListWidgetItem,
    QTreeWidget, QTreeWidgetItem, QSplitter, QScrollArea, QSpinBox,
    QCheckBox, QComboBox,
)
from PyQt6.QtCore import Qt, pyqtSignal
from app.theme import COLORS
from app.widgets.video_preview import VideoPreview
from app.editing.trim import TrimHandler
from app.editing.concat import ConcatHandler
from app.effects.pipeline import EffectPipeline
from app.effects.registry import EffectRegistry
from app.effects.base import EffectParam
from app.ffmpeg.probe import FFprobeReader
from app.utils.file_utils import format_duration, format_filesize


class EditTab(QWidget):
    """视频工作台 — 播放 + 编辑 + 特效"""

    source_changed = pyqtSignal(str)

    def __init__(self, parent=None):
        super().__init__(parent)
        self._source_file = ""
        self._trim = TrimHandler()
        self._concat = ConcatHandler()
        self._pipeline = EffectPipeline(self)
        self._pipeline.effects_changed.connect(self._on_pipeline_change)
        self._init_ui()

    def _init_ui(self):
        root = QVBoxLayout(self)
        root.setContentsMargins(16, 12, 16, 12)
        root.setSpacing(10)

        # === 顶部工具栏 ===
        toolbar = QHBoxLayout()
        title = QLabel("🎬 视频工作台")
        title.setStyleSheet(f"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: {COLORS['text_primary']};")
        toolbar.addWidget(title)

        self._open_btn = QPushButton("📂 导入视频")
        self._open_btn.clicked.connect(self._open_file)
        toolbar.addWidget(self._open_btn)

        self._info_label = QLabel("未加载视频")
        self._info_label.setStyleSheet(f"color: {COLORS['text_secondary']}; font-size: 12px;")
        toolbar.addWidget(self._info_label)
        toolbar.addStretch()
        root.addLayout(toolbar)

        # === 主体：播放器 + 右侧面板 ===
        body = QSplitter(Qt.Orientation.Horizontal)

        # --- 左侧：播放器 ---
        left = QWidget()
        left_layout = QVBoxLayout(left)
        left_layout.setContentsMargins(0, 0, 8, 0)

        self._preview = VideoPreview()
        self._preview.duration_loaded.connect(lambda d: self._trim_end.setValue(d))
        left_layout.addWidget(self._preview, 1)

        body.addWidget(left)

        # --- 右侧：工具面板（滚动） ---
        right_scroll = QScrollArea()
        right_scroll.setWidgetResizable(True)
        right_scroll.setMinimumWidth(360)
        right_scroll.setMaximumWidth(480)

        right = QWidget()
        right_layout = QVBoxLayout(right)
        right_layout.setSpacing(10)

        # ---- 裁剪 ----
        trim_grp = QGroupBox("✂ 时间裁剪")
        trim_lay = QVBoxLayout(trim_grp)
        r1 = QHBoxLayout(); r1.addWidget(QLabel("起始(秒):"))
        self._trim_start = QDoubleSpinBox(); self._trim_start.setRange(0, 99999); self._trim_start.setDecimals(1)
        self._trim_start.valueChanged.connect(lambda v: setattr(self._trim, 'start_sec', v))
        r1.addWidget(self._trim_start); trim_lay.addLayout(r1)

        r2 = QHBoxLayout(); r2.addWidget(QLabel("结束(秒):"))
        self._trim_end = QDoubleSpinBox(); self._trim_end.setRange(0, 99999); self._trim_end.setDecimals(1)
        self._trim_end.valueChanged.connect(lambda v: setattr(self._trim, 'end_sec', v))
        r2.addWidget(self._trim_end); trim_lay.addLayout(r2)

        trim_btns = QHBoxLayout()
        mark_btn = QPushButton("设起点")
        mark_btn.clicked.connect(lambda: self._trim_start.setValue(self._preview.get_position()))
        trim_btns.addWidget(mark_btn)
        mark_end_btn = QPushButton("设终点")
        mark_end_btn.clicked.connect(lambda: self._trim_end.setValue(self._preview.get_position()))
        trim_btns.addWidget(mark_end_btn)
        reset_btn = QPushButton("重置")
        reset_btn.clicked.connect(self._reset_trim)
        trim_btns.addWidget(reset_btn)
        trim_lay.addLayout(trim_btns)

        self._preview_trim_btn = QPushButton("▶ 预览裁剪范围")
        self._preview_trim_btn.clicked.connect(self._preview_trim)
        trim_lay.addWidget(self._preview_trim_btn)

        right_layout.addWidget(trim_grp)

        # ---- 特效 ----
        fx_grp = QGroupBox("✦ 已添加特效")
        fx_lay = QVBoxLayout(fx_grp)

        self._fx_list = QListWidget()
        fx_lay.addWidget(self._fx_list)

        fx_btns = QHBoxLayout()
        self._fx_tree = QTreeWidget()
        self._fx_tree.setHeaderHidden(True)
        self._fx_tree.setMaximumHeight(160)
        self._populate_fx_tree()
        self._fx_tree.itemDoubleClicked.connect(self._add_fx)
        fx_lay.addWidget(self._fx_tree)

        rm_fx = QPushButton("✕ 移除选中"); rm_fx.clicked.connect(self._remove_fx)
        fx_btns.addWidget(rm_fx)
        fx_lay.addLayout(fx_btns)

        # 特效参数
        self._fx_params = QWidget()
        self._fx_params_layout = QVBoxLayout(self._fx_params)
        self._fx_params_layout.setContentsMargins(0, 0, 0, 0)
        fx_lay.addWidget(self._fx_params)

        self._fx_list.itemClicked.connect(self._on_fx_select)
        right_layout.addWidget(fx_grp)

        # ---- 拼接 ----
        concat_grp = QGroupBox("🔗 视频拼接")
        concat_lay = QVBoxLayout(concat_grp)
        self._concat_list = QListWidget()
        self._concat_list.setMaximumHeight(80)
        concat_lay.addWidget(self._concat_list)
        c_btns = QHBoxLayout()
        add_c = QPushButton("+ 添加视频"); add_c.clicked.connect(self._add_concat)
        c_btns.addWidget(add_c)
        rm_c = QPushButton("- 移除"); rm_c.clicked.connect(self._remove_concat)
        c_btns.addWidget(rm_c)
        concat_lay.addLayout(c_btns)
        right_layout.addWidget(concat_grp)

        right_layout.addStretch()
        right_scroll.setWidget(right)
        body.addWidget(right_scroll)
        body.setSizes([700, 380])

        root.addWidget(body, 1)

    # ===== 文件操作 =====
    def _open_file(self):
        path, _ = QFileDialog.getOpenFileName(self, "选择视频", "",
            "视频 (*.mp4 *.mov *.avi *.mkv *.webm *.flv *.wmv);;全部 (*.*)")
        if path:
            self.load_source(path)

    def load_source(self, filepath: str):
        self._source_file = filepath
        self._preview.load_video(filepath)
        probe = FFprobeReader(filepath)
        info = probe.get_video_info()
        dur = info.get("duration", 0)
        self._info_label.setText(
            f"{info.get('width',0)}x{info.get('height',0)} | "
            f"{format_duration(dur)} | "
            f"{format_filesize(info.get('size_bytes',0))}"
        )
        self._trim_end.setValue(dur)
        self._concat.add_file(filepath)
        self._concat_list.addItem(os.path.basename(filepath))
        self.source_changed.emit(filepath)

    # ===== 裁剪 =====
    def _reset_trim(self):
        self._trim_start.setValue(0)
        probe = FFprobeReader(self._source_file)
        self._trim_end.setValue(probe.duration)

    def _preview_trim(self):
        """预览裁剪起点"""
        self._preview.set_position(self._trim_start.value())
        self._preview._player.play()

    # ===== 特效 =====
    def _populate_fx_tree(self):
        from app.effects import time, spatial, color, blur_noise, overlay, keying, audio, combo  # noqa
        for cat, names in sorted(EffectRegistry.all_categories().items()):
            cat_item = QTreeWidgetItem([cat])
            for n in sorted(names):
                child = QTreeWidgetItem([n])
                child.setData(0, Qt.ItemDataRole.UserRole, n)
                cat_item.addChild(child)
            self._fx_tree.addTopLevelItem(cat_item)
        self._fx_tree.expandAll()

    def _add_fx(self, item, col):
        name = item.data(0, Qt.ItemDataRole.UserRole)
        if not name: return
        eff = EffectRegistry.instantiate(name)
        if eff:
            self._pipeline.add(eff)
            self._refresh_fx_list()

    def _remove_fx(self):
        row = self._fx_list.currentRow()
        if row >= 0:
            self._pipeline.remove(row)
            self._refresh_fx_list()

    def _refresh_fx_list(self):
        self._fx_list.clear()
        for e in self._pipeline:
            icon = "✅" if e.enabled else "❌"
            item = QListWidgetItem(f"{icon} {e.name}")
            item.setData(Qt.ItemDataRole.UserRole, self._pipeline._effects.index(e))
            self._fx_list.addItem(item)

    def _on_fx_select(self, item):
        idx = item.data(Qt.ItemDataRole.UserRole)
        if idx is None or idx >= len(self._pipeline): return
        self._show_fx_params(idx)

    def _show_fx_params(self, idx: int):
        # 清旧
        while self._fx_params_layout.count():
            c = self._fx_params_layout.takeAt(0)
            if c.widget(): c.widget().deleteLater()

        eff = self._pipeline[idx]
        cb = QCheckBox("启用")
        cb.setChecked(eff.enabled)
        cb.toggled.connect(lambda v: (setattr(eff, 'enabled', v), self._refresh_fx_list(), self._on_pipeline_change()))
        self._fx_params_layout.addWidget(cb)

        for p in eff.get_param_defs():
            lbl = QLabel(p.label)
            lbl.setStyleSheet(f"color: {COLORS['text_secondary']}; font-size: 11px;")
            self._fx_params_layout.addWidget(lbl)

            if p.options:
                w = QComboBox()
                for val, lab in p.options: w.addItem(lab, val)
                w.setCurrentIndex(max(0, [o[0] for o in p.options].index(eff.get_param(p.name))))
                w.currentIndexChanged.connect(lambda i, n=p.name, o=p.options: (eff.set_param(n, o[i][0]), self._on_pipeline_change()))
                self._fx_params_layout.addWidget(w)
            elif p.param_type is float:
                w = QDoubleSpinBox()
                if p.min_val is not None: w.setRange(p.min_val, p.max_val or 100)
                if p.step: w.setSingleStep(p.step)
                w.setValue(eff.get_param(p.name) or 0)
                if p.suffix: w.setSuffix(f" {p.suffix}")
                w.valueChanged.connect(lambda v, n=p.name: (eff.set_param(n, v), self._on_pipeline_change()))
                self._fx_params_layout.addWidget(w)
            elif p.param_type is int:
                w = QSpinBox()
                if p.min_val is not None: w.setRange(int(p.min_val), int(p.max_val or 100))
                w.setValue(eff.get_param(p.name) or 0)
                if p.suffix: w.setSuffix(f" {p.suffix}")
                w.valueChanged.connect(lambda v, n=p.name: (eff.set_param(n, v), self._on_pipeline_change()))
                self._fx_params_layout.addWidget(w)

    def _on_pipeline_change(self):
        pass  # 已通过 effects_changed 信号通知外部

    # ===== 拼接 =====
    def _add_concat(self):
        path, _ = QFileDialog.getOpenFileName(self, "选择要拼接的视频", "", "视频 (*.mp4 *.mov *.avi *.mkv *.webm)")
        if path:
            self._concat.add_file(path)
            self._concat_list.addItem(os.path.basename(path))

    def _remove_concat(self):
        row = self._concat_list.currentRow()
        if row >= 0:
            self._concat_list.takeItem(row)
            self._concat.remove_file(row)

    # ===== 公开 =====
    def get_source(self) -> str: return self._source_file
    def get_trim(self) -> TrimHandler: return self._trim
    def get_pipeline(self) -> EffectPipeline: return self._pipeline
